# Assistant content: a reply long enough to push earlier paragraphs off
# the top of a 120x40 window, so scrolling back (KEY pgup / SCROLL up)
# (KEY pgup; the wheel is blocked, see drive.py SCROLL) is needed to see the start of the reply again.
@faux testdata/faux/qa/content-long.yaml
@size 120x40

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
SHOT welcome
TYPE explain the change
KEY enter
WAITFOR /flag comes out in the following release/ 20
SHOT reply-bottom
EXPECT /Paragraph seven wraps up/
EXPECT_NOT /Paragraph one covers the upload route/
KEY pgup
KEY pgup
KEY pgup
SHOT reply-scrolled-up
EXPECT /Paragraph one covers the upload route/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
